per-Font bounded caches, reload invalidation, NameProtect integration and
position-aware particle cache invalidation across the three native clients.
Updated 2026-11-03 against ZakoOpt 2.0.4: bubble-column fluid lookups use a
bounded thread-local cache, weak world identity and game-tick/block-update/chunk
invalidation. Held-item rotations on 1.21.4 and 1.21.11 reuse thread-local
quaternions at immediate pose-stack consumption sites; 26.3 already uses
allocation-free pose rotation. These are selected source adaptations, not the
complete ZakoOpt mod; its GPU rings, skin atlas and mesh replay are not included.
